

# Kubernetes MongoDB + Mongo Express Demo

This project demonstrates how to deploy a MongoDB database and Mongo Express web application on Kubernetes.

Mongo Express provides a web interface to manage MongoDB. The application is exposed externally, while MongoDB remains accessible only within the Kubernetes cluster through an internal service.

