## Project Overview

The project contains:

- Kubernetes Secrets
- Kubernetes ConfigMaps
- MongoDB Deployment
- MongoDB Internal Service (ClusterIP)
- Mongo Express Deployment
- Mongo Express External Service (NodePort/LoadBalancer)

---

## Architecture Flow

```text
Browser
   │
   ▼
Mongo Express External Service
   │
   ▼
Mongo Express Pod
   │
   ▼
MongoDB Internal Service
   │
   ▼
MongoDB Pod
```


## Browser Request Flow

1. User opens Mongo Express in the browser.
2. Browser sends request to Mongo Express External Service.
3. External Service forwards request to Mongo Express Pod.
4. Mongo Express communicates with MongoDB Internal Service.
5. Internal Service routes traffic to MongoDB Pod.
6. MongoDB returns data.
7. Mongo Express displays the data in the browser.
